Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2687293Z       # Annotations work in forks where GitHub Advanced Security and code\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2687897Z       # scanning may not be enabled, while still making findings fail loudly.\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2688576Z       #\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2688917Z       # `version` is named rather than left at the default, because the\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2689438Z       # action's `latest` entry is its own frozen table (for example v0.6.4 -> zizmor\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2690024Z       # 1.30.1), not the latest zizmor. Naming the version keeps the next bump\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2690613Z       # a visible line in the diff rather than a side effect of bumping the\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2691149Z       # action, and documents exactly which analyser reproduces a finding\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2691915Z       # (issue #6).\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2692145Z       - name: Audit workflow files\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2692427Z         uses: zizmorcore/zizmor-action@v0.8.1\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2692710Z         with:\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2692910Z           advanced-security: false\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2693164Z           annotations: true\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2693414Z           config: .github/zizmor.yml\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2693667Z           inputs: .github\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2693898Z           min-confidence: medium\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2694140Z           version: 1.31.1\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2694343Z \n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2694621Z       # The step above runs the default (regular) persona, which is the right\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2695111Z       # default: pedantic surfaces dozens of stylistic findings. But the audits\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2695609Z       # that cover container image references (`unpinned-images` among them)\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2696064Z       # are Pedantic-only, so the `'*': hash-pin` policy declared in\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2696518Z       # .github/zizmor.yml is not enforced against `uses: docker://` or\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2697013Z       # `container:` references by the regular pass. Narrowing this second pass\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2697554Z       # to high severity *and* high confidence keeps that enforcement without\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2698219Z       # importing the noise. Measured: after the digest pin above it reports\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2698697Z       # nothing, and stays silent until someone reintroduces a mutable image\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2699072Z       # reference (issue #5).\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2699378Z       - name: Audit for pedantic-only high-severity findings\n
Test (PHP 8.1)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:42.2699709Z         timeout-minutes: 5\n
