Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7907439Z       # `version` is named rather than left at the default, because the\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7907917Z       # action's `latest` entry is its own frozen table (for example v0.6.4 -> zizmor\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7908300Z       # 1.30.1), not the latest zizmor. Naming the version keeps the next bump\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7908655Z       # a visible line in the diff rather than a side effect of bumping the\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7909005Z       # action, and documents exactly which analyser reproduces a finding\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7909281Z       # (issue #6).\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7909465Z       - name: Audit workflow files\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7909689Z         uses: zizmorcore/zizmor-action@v0.8.1\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7909925Z         with:\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7910091Z           advanced-security: false\n
