Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7910499Z           config: .github/zizmor.yml\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7910783Z           inputs: .github\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7911076Z           min-confidence: medium\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7911384Z           version: 1.31.1\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7911648Z \n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7912021Z       # The step above runs the default (regular) persona, which is the right\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7912532Z       # default: pedantic surfaces dozens of stylistic findings. But the audits\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7913031Z       # that cover container image references (`unpinned-images` among them)\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7913407Z       # are Pedantic-only, so the `'*': hash-pin` policy declared in\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7913761Z       # .github/zizmor.yml is not enforced against `uses: docker://` or\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7914137Z       # `container:` references by the regular pass. Narrowing this second pass\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7914570Z       # to high severity *and* high confidence keeps that enforcement without\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7915103Z       # importing the noise. Measured: after the digest pin above it reports\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7915469Z       # nothing, and stays silent until someone reintroduces a mutable image\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7915760Z       # reference (issue #5).\n
Test (PHP 8.3)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:50.7916013Z       - name: Audit for pedantic-only high-severity findings\n
