Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2130016Z       # action's `latest` entry is its own frozen table (for example v0.6.4 -> zizmor\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2130489Z       # 1.30.1), not the latest zizmor. Naming the version keeps the next bump\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2130901Z       # a visible line in the diff rather than a side effect of bumping the\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2131300Z       # action, and documents exactly which analyser reproduces a finding\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2131626Z       # (issue #6).\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2131895Z       - name: Audit workflow files\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2132182Z         uses: zizmorcore/zizmor-action@v0.8.1\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2132459Z         with:\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2132688Z           advanced-security: false\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2132941Z           annotations: true\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2133172Z           config: .github/zizmor.yml\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2133448Z           inputs: .github\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2133704Z           min-confidence: medium\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2134002Z           version: 1.31.1\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2134252Z \n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2134515Z       # The step above runs the default (regular) persona, which is the right\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2134947Z       # default: pedantic surfaces dozens of stylistic findings. But the audits\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2135378Z       # that cover container image references (`unpinned-images` among them)\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2135759Z       # are Pedantic-only, so the `'*': hash-pin` policy declared in\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2136224Z       # .github/zizmor.yml is not enforced against `uses: docker://` or\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2136628Z       # `container:` references by the regular pass. Narrowing this second pass\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2137131Z       # to high severity *and* high confidence keeps that enforcement without\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2137550Z       # importing the noise. Measured: after the digest pin above it reports\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2137948Z       # nothing, and stays silent until someone reintroduces a mutable image\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2138288Z       # reference (issue #5).\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2138578Z       - name: Audit for pedantic-only high-severity findings\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2138912Z         timeout-minutes: 5\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2139155Z         run: |\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2139662Z           pipx run zizmor==1.31.1 --config .github/zizmor.yml \\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2140065Z             --persona pedantic --min-severity high --min-confidence high \\n
Test (PHP 8.4)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:24:31.2140410Z             .github\n
