Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1984047Z       # that cover container image references (`unpinned-images` among them)\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1984402Z       # are Pedantic-only, so the `'*': hash-pin` policy declared in\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1984758Z       # .github/zizmor.yml is not enforced against `uses: docker://` or\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1985175Z       # `container:` references by the regular pass. Narrowing this second pass\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1985574Z       # to high severity *and* high confidence keeps that enforcement without\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1986097Z       # importing the noise. Measured: after the digest pin above it reports\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1986473Z       # nothing, and stays silent until someone reintroduces a mutable image\n
Test (PHP 8.2)	Run tests	2026-11-13T21:21:48.1986767Z       # reference (issue #5).\n
